# SmartTask

A production-ready MERN Stack project built from scratch to master Full Stack Development, System Design fundamentals, and interview concepts.

## Tech Stack

- React
- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB

## Goals

- Learn MERN deeply
- Understand internals
- Build production-grade architecture
- Master Java DSA alongside development
- Become interview-ready (8–20 LPA target)